  "prefLabel": "Env-A 804.23 Solvent Metal Cold Cleaners, Open Top Degreasing and Conveyorized Degreasing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 804.23 Solvent Metal Cold Cleaners, Open Top Degreasing and Conveyorized Degreasing. The owner or operator of a solvent metal cold cleaner, open top vapor degreasing operation, or conveyorized degreasing operation shall use the following test methods:\n\n(a) Visual inspection for compliance with equipment specifications and operating procedures; and\n\n(b) When compliance is by add-on control systems:\n\n(1) Methods 1-4 in 40 CFR 60, Appendix A, for determining flow rates;\n\n(2) Methods 18, 25, 25A or 25B in 40 CFR 60, Appendix A, for determining gaseous organic concentrations; and\n\n(3) ASTM D323-08 for measuring solvent true vapor pressure.\n\nSource. #9802, eff 10-31-10 (from Env-A 804.21); ss by #12762, eff 5-1-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a800.html"
